WEBVTT

00:05.830 --> 00:07.040
Iona...?

00:07.040 --> 00:08.870
Iona!

00:08.870 --> 00:11.170
M-Mayu...

00:12.010 --> 00:13.840
Looks like mommy's mad.

00:13.840 --> 00:14.680
Iona!

00:14.680 --> 00:17.750
What's the matter? Are you okay, Iona?!

00:17.750 --> 00:19.350
I-I'm fine...

00:19.350 --> 00:21.720
Mayu can't kill me.

00:21.720 --> 00:26.250
I'm Mayu's friend, and Mayu's child.

00:26.250 --> 00:27.460
And...

00:27.460 --> 00:29.290
...I'm also Mayu herself.

00:29.290 --> 00:30.090
Mayu...

00:30.090 --> 00:31.130
...herself?

00:31.130 --> 00:34.460
Urith loves me...

00:34.460 --> 00:36.630
That girl...

00:36.630 --> 00:39.900
...was raised alone since she was born...

00:39.900 --> 00:41.700
...without knowing the outside world.

01:04.760 --> 01:06.260
<i>Taken and granted,</i>

01:06.260 --> 01:10.270
<i>ideals are repetitious games that slip through</i>

01:10.270 --> 01:12.970
<i>My daily life is so shot with holes</i>

01:12.970 --> 01:15.840
<i>that I can barely stand</i>

01:15.840 --> 01:17.140
<i>Empty theories without conclusions</i>

01:17.140 --> 01:21.340
<i>Dance steps along invisible rules</i>

01:21.340 --> 01:26.350
<i>The final bell holding together</i> <i>the crumbling day rings</i>

01:26.350 --> 01:30.790
<i>In the scene I imagine</i>

01:30.790 --> 01:33.420
<i>you're there</i>

01:33.420 --> 01:36.190
<i>with a smile</i>

01:36.190 --> 01:41.700
<i>No forgiveness? No desires?</i>

01:41.700 --> 01:45.160
<i>And still</i>

01:46.800 --> 01:50.000
<i>We cry "OPEN"</i>

01:50.000 --> 01:54.310
<i>A future to get back and a world to destroy</i>

01:54.310 --> 01:56.710
<i>A wish to open. GOT IT?</i>

01:56.710 --> 01:58.380
<i>Now cross</i>

01:58.380 --> 02:01.150
<i>I wish you don't cry</i>

02:01.150 --> 02:08.120
<i>The future of light and dark,</i> <i>let's believe in the "future"</i>

02:08.120 --> 02:14.620
<i>so that they overlap to gain color again</i>

02:16.530 --> 02:20.140
The girl was all alone...

02:20.140 --> 02:23.330
...without knowing what being "alone" meant.

02:32.650 --> 02:38.190
Every so often, something came and did something to her.

02:38.190 --> 02:40.920
She didn't know anything.

02:40.920 --> 02:44.980
Who she was, and why she was there...

02:48.000 --> 02:49.700
That...

02:49.700 --> 02:51.870
...was her everything.

02:51.870 --> 02:53.600
Her world...

02:55.740 --> 02:57.710
"Friend"

02:57.270 --> 03:00.400
She then noticed things being placed around her.

03:01.740 --> 03:06.940
Periodically, something would come by to bring things to her.

03:10.420 --> 03:12.690
She had no idea why.

03:12.690 --> 03:16.060
Maybe there was pity towards the girl.

03:16.060 --> 03:18.620
Or, maybe it was just a whim.

03:29.240 --> 03:31.310
What...

03:31.310 --> 03:33.740
...is...this?

03:37.480 --> 03:40.320
She then found out.

03:40.320 --> 03:46.590
Beyond that window, there's a world outside that she's not aware of.

03:49.890 --> 03:55.330
That there are many girls out there that look like her.

03:55.830 --> 03:57.490
"...a lot of friends..."

03:57.830 --> 04:02.400
Frie... nd...

04:02.400 --> 04:05.770
Their wish... came true...

04:03.300 --> 04:05.640
"Their wish came true, and everyone

04:03.300 --> 04:05.640
lived happily ever after"

04:07.010 --> 04:08.780
Wish...

04:08.780 --> 04:10.400
Then one day...

04:14.150 --> 04:19.320
She understood that it was some sort of plaything...

04:19.320 --> 04:22.090
...and that it couldn't be played by herself.

04:29.800 --> 04:32.160
She then...

04:59.990 --> 05:02.230
...created friends.

05:03.200 --> 05:04.700
Friends...?

05:04.700 --> 05:11.370
Imaginary friends that were only in her mind and only she could see.

05:11.370 --> 05:15.680
You're the Girl of Light, the good girl, Shiro.

05:15.680 --> 05:19.810
You're the Girl of Dark, the bad girl, Kuro.

05:19.810 --> 05:22.650
We're friends from today.

05:22.650 --> 05:24.590
Yup, nice to meet you...

05:24.590 --> 05:27.420
Sure, I'll be your friend...

05:31.160 --> 05:33.830
Shiro's going to summon Tlet...

05:33.830 --> 05:36.000
That won't work, Shiro.

05:36.000 --> 05:38.370
I'll stop that with Vimana...

05:38.370 --> 05:41.200
Aah... no...

05:41.200 --> 05:42.900
It's Kuro's turn next...

05:42.900 --> 05:44.840
Here I go... Attack...

05:44.840 --> 05:47.400
Yikes, she got me...

05:48.680 --> 05:51.580
Now, it's your turn, Shiro. Do your best.

05:51.580 --> 05:54.180
Yup, Shiro will do her best...

05:54.180 --> 05:57.890
Next, she started a certain game.

05:57.890 --> 05:59.890
Outside world...?

05:59.890 --> 06:01.390
Yes.

06:01.390 --> 06:06.190
Shiro and Kuro are going to bring girls from the outside world here.

06:06.190 --> 06:10.370
You'll tell them that if they win the game, their wish will come true.

06:10.370 --> 06:12.200
Then what...?

06:12.200 --> 06:14.870
Shiro and Kuro are going to play WIXOSS,

06:14.870 --> 06:18.240
and whoever wins will be granted the wish of the girl they brought.

06:18.240 --> 06:21.780
What's going to happen to that girl...?

06:21.780 --> 06:24.380
She'll be sealed away in the world of cards.

06:24.380 --> 06:28.450
For her to escape from there, she'll have to bring another girl.

06:28.450 --> 06:30.820
What about the girl who loses...?

06:30.820 --> 06:33.490
Her wish won't come true.

06:33.490 --> 06:35.760
No.

06:35.760 --> 06:38.330
That's not all.

06:38.330 --> 06:41.000
Her wish will be reversed.

06:41.000 --> 06:42.130
That's...

06:42.130 --> 06:44.070
...a Selector battle?

06:44.070 --> 06:45.400
Oh...?

06:49.600 --> 06:52.640
But, isn't that mean...?

06:52.640 --> 06:53.940
Why?

06:53.940 --> 06:57.780
That girl can choose whether she wants to play or not.

06:57.780 --> 06:59.910
She doesn't have to play if she doesn't want to.

06:59.910 --> 07:02.120
Hm, that sounds fun...

07:02.120 --> 07:04.650
Right? Now, let's do this.

07:04.650 --> 07:07.160
Yup, Shiro will do it, too.

07:07.160 --> 07:09.620
And so, it began...

07:11.830 --> 07:14.930
It's Shiro's turn... Here I go, Kuro...

07:14.930 --> 07:17.670
Rococo Boundary...!

07:17.670 --> 07:20.500
Wow, that's great, Shiro!

07:20.500 --> 07:23.670
Shiro-<i>chan</i>, please do your best for me...!

07:25.540 --> 07:28.440
I want to become a florist...

07:28.440 --> 07:30.780
Yup, Shiro will do her best...

07:30.780 --> 07:33.040
Now, it's your turn, Kuro.

07:34.980 --> 07:37.650
I won't lose to you yet, Shiro...

07:37.650 --> 07:41.160
I hope Kuro-<i>chan</i> wins so that
I can become a princess...

07:41.160 --> 07:43.360
Dark Matter...!

07:43.360 --> 07:45.530
Okay! Kuro wins!

07:45.530 --> 07:47.660
Kuro-<i>chan</i>, thank you...!

07:47.660 --> 07:50.150
I'm sorry, I lost...

07:51.370 --> 07:53.330
I lost...

07:53.330 --> 07:56.840
Now that you lost, your dream will be reversed.

07:56.840 --> 07:59.670
You won't become a florist.

08:01.410 --> 08:03.080
And, that's not all.

08:03.080 --> 08:07.980
You will never be able to smell or see flowers anymore.

08:07.980 --> 08:10.750
You'll go to a world where flowers don't exist.

08:13.990 --> 08:16.490
Now I can become a princess...!

08:16.490 --> 08:17.650
No.

08:21.160 --> 08:24.170
Kuro will fulfill your dream.

08:24.170 --> 08:28.670
If you want to escape, bring a girl to replace you.

08:28.670 --> 08:32.510
And so, the world she bore...

08:32.510 --> 08:35.680
...began to bear bright colors.

08:35.680 --> 08:37.610
Within the imaginary world...

08:37.610 --> 08:39.780
...the girls' laughter...

08:39.780 --> 08:41.220
...their cries...

08:41.220 --> 08:42.920
...their screams...

08:42.920 --> 08:45.180
...resonated over and over again.

08:46.420 --> 08:47.790
But...

08:47.790 --> 08:51.260
...the more her imaginary world gained reality...

08:51.260 --> 08:54.930
...the more she knew...

08:54.930 --> 08:57.430
...where she was.

08:57.430 --> 09:02.370
A world of truth where there are no colors or voices...

09:05.140 --> 09:08.040
Say, Shiro, Kuro?

09:08.040 --> 09:10.140
Isn't it strange?

09:10.140 --> 09:15.250
You're my friends, but I'm the only one here.

09:15.250 --> 09:18.650
Not only can't I wish...

09:18.650 --> 09:22.660
I can't even see what a florist is like.

09:22.660 --> 09:26.930
Say, Mayu...? What is Mayu's wish...?

09:26.930 --> 09:29.960
Shiro and Kuro will fulfill your wish...

09:29.960 --> 09:33.660
Really? You're both so kind.

09:36.970 --> 09:39.310
My...

09:39.310 --> 09:40.800
...wish...

09:48.820 --> 09:51.990
That girl is...

09:51.990 --> 09:55.820
This is... me, Tama...

09:55.820 --> 09:57.820
...and Mayu's story.

10:00.160 --> 10:03.360
Then... my meeting with Mayu...

10:03.360 --> 10:05.170
Yes...

10:05.170 --> 10:08.170
She's still wishing...

10:08.170 --> 10:11.140
Even now, in that very room...

10:11.140 --> 10:14.440
...she's wishing all alone.

10:15.880 --> 10:18.210
And I...

10:20.350 --> 10:21.710
Huh?

10:22.650 --> 10:24.490
Huh?

10:24.490 --> 10:26.550
Wh-Where am I...?

10:28.820 --> 10:32.820
It was then I understood everything.

10:34.460 --> 10:38.130
So... Is that so...

10:42.970 --> 10:46.870
I'm Kuro. I'll fulfill your wish.

10:48.680 --> 10:51.010
That was Mayu's wish...

10:51.010 --> 10:53.350
...that she yearns for from that room.

10:53.350 --> 10:57.050
Strongly... Sharply... Earnestly...

10:57.050 --> 10:59.690
What is Mayu-<i>san</i>'s wish?

10:59.690 --> 11:01.090
Revenge.

11:02.320 --> 11:07.330
To those who live in the outside world, who are allowed to have wishes...

11:07.330 --> 11:11.560
To all the girls who are allowed to select...

11:14.770 --> 11:15.930
Revenge...

11:17.170 --> 11:19.000
Revenge...

11:24.180 --> 11:29.350
The other girls Mayu bore became LRIGs, and...

11:29.350 --> 11:32.580
...I continued my battles against them.

11:33.790 --> 11:36.720
What happened to the LRIGs who lost?

11:36.720 --> 11:42.030
They disappeared and their
Selectors replaced them as LRIGs.

11:42.030 --> 11:44.700
The only LRIGs Mayu bore who are still alive...

11:44.700 --> 11:46.070
...are me...

11:46.070 --> 11:47.370
...and Tama.

11:49.140 --> 11:52.410
Winning led me to become a human.

11:52.410 --> 11:53.970
Then...

11:53.970 --> 11:56.880
...an LRIG came to me.

11:58.980 --> 12:02.220
I continued to battle to become an LRIG again...

12:02.220 --> 12:06.750
...then a Selector, then an LRIG again, and continued my life as such.

12:06.750 --> 12:08.220
Why...?

12:08.220 --> 12:09.960
I thought I told you...

12:09.960 --> 12:12.960
...that's just what I am.

12:12.960 --> 12:13.960
Kuro...?

12:13.960 --> 12:16.630
Yes, you're Kuro.

12:16.630 --> 12:18.270
The bad girl, Kuro.

12:18.270 --> 12:23.140
You battle for eternity to bring misery to all.

12:23.140 --> 12:26.840
That's your fate as the Girl of Dark.

12:28.410 --> 12:31.580
After repeating myself between being an LRIG and Selector...

12:31.580 --> 12:34.610
...I became Urazoe Iona, and then...

12:37.820 --> 12:40.320
...Urith came to me...

12:40.320 --> 12:44.260
...in the form from back when I was called Kuro.

12:44.260 --> 12:46.290
Urith...

12:46.290 --> 12:49.830
But, why the change in form?

12:49.830 --> 12:51.170
Playing with dolls...

12:51.170 --> 12:54.300
We're just dolls...?

12:54.300 --> 12:56.440
Guess everyone was just being played with...

12:56.440 --> 12:58.610
But, you're friends, right?

12:58.610 --> 13:02.780
You said that you and Tama are
Mayu's friends, and Mayu herself.

13:02.780 --> 13:04.480
That makes no difference...

13:04.480 --> 13:06.180
...to her at all.

13:06.180 --> 13:07.880
I don't care...

13:07.880 --> 13:12.390
Even if it was someone's wish, or even if this is some game, I was able to meet Urith...

13:12.390 --> 13:14.890
I was able to meet Urith!

13:14.890 --> 13:16.560
She's lost it...

13:16.560 --> 13:18.830
Battling is my fate.

13:18.830 --> 13:23.130
But, I started to become serious as the battles continued.

13:23.130 --> 13:24.900
Serious?

13:24.900 --> 13:27.330
It was the first time I felt like I was alive.

13:27.330 --> 13:30.670
I felt my own soul and my own body.

13:30.670 --> 13:34.670
I felt... that I really am alive.

13:35.710 --> 13:41.580
Since then, I've sought to become stronger by looking for the greatest of Selectors.

13:41.580 --> 13:45.320
Then I met you, Ru...

13:45.320 --> 13:49.090
And... You were there, Shiro.

13:49.090 --> 13:53.330
I lost to Ru, and my wish came true, but...

13:53.330 --> 13:55.200
...you didn't battle.

13:55.200 --> 13:57.060
I couldn't forgive you.

13:58.670 --> 14:02.700
You're supposed to be the same as me, and yet you cuddled with simpletons...

14:02.700 --> 14:05.610
That seemed nonsensical to me!

14:06.670 --> 14:10.870
But then, Ru entered me...

14:11.880 --> 14:15.540
It felt nice and warm...

14:17.250 --> 14:21.060
So that's what you felt, wasn't it, Tama?

14:21.060 --> 14:22.920
You and Ru's strength...

14:22.920 --> 14:25.730
...comes from bonding with others and feeling empathy.

14:25.730 --> 14:30.530
You experienced that and felt that, so you were able to change, too.

14:30.530 --> 14:34.300
That's why you refused to do the battles you loved.

14:36.870 --> 14:40.270
You have something more important than battling now, right?

14:40.270 --> 14:43.780
Tama don't need to battle...

14:43.780 --> 14:46.300
I like Ru more than battles.

14:47.820 --> 14:48.980
Tama...

14:48.980 --> 14:50.550
I like Yuzuki.

14:50.550 --> 14:52.050
I like Hitoe.

14:52.050 --> 14:53.550
I like Grandma.

14:53.550 --> 14:55.320
I like everyone!

14:55.320 --> 14:56.390
Tama...!

14:56.390 --> 15:00.060
I want Mayu to become friends with everyone...

15:00.060 --> 15:04.430
Then she'll stop doing this!
No one has to battle anymore!

15:04.430 --> 15:07.970
Tama? Did you get your memory back?!

15:07.970 --> 15:08.800
Ah!

15:08.800 --> 15:09.670
Huh?!

15:09.670 --> 15:13.840
Mayu was lonely being all by herself...

15:13.840 --> 15:16.810
But, Tama forgot all about Mayu...

15:16.810 --> 15:22.920
Tama, you said that you felt you could return all the girls back from LRIGs, right?

15:22.920 --> 15:25.820
Yup, but I'm not too sure...

15:25.820 --> 15:29.590
You said that because you're Mayu's light.

15:29.590 --> 15:31.790
Mayu-<i>san</i>'s light?

15:31.790 --> 15:35.630
You and I changed being with Ru and the others.

15:35.630 --> 15:36.430
If so...

15:36.430 --> 15:39.370
Mayu can become friends with Ru and everyone?

15:39.370 --> 15:43.170
Yes. Let's both show her the feelings we hold.

15:43.170 --> 15:45.040
If that happens...

15:45.040 --> 15:50.950
...then we can end Selector battles, and save all the girls who turned into LRIGs, right?!

15:52.850 --> 15:55.520
Iona... Tama...!

15:55.520 --> 15:57.550
You can hear us, right, Mayu?!

15:57.550 --> 15:59.620
Playtime is over.

15:59.620 --> 16:03.560
We'll bring you out from there!

16:05.160 --> 16:07.900
Wh-What...?!

16:07.900 --> 16:10.000
What's with those girls?!

16:10.000 --> 16:12.000
No...! So scary...!

16:12.000 --> 16:14.570
To save everyone...

16:14.570 --> 16:16.040
...we need to defeat Urith!

16:16.040 --> 16:20.240
If we can beat her, we'll finally be able to save Tama!

16:20.240 --> 16:24.040
Then Tama-<i>chan</i> and Iona-<i>san</i> can be together again!

16:26.550 --> 16:29.650
I'm tired of all this nonsense.

16:29.650 --> 16:33.390
It's supposed to be my turn next, you know?

16:33.390 --> 16:37.320
This is great, seeing everyone shining brilliantly with hope...

16:37.320 --> 16:38.390
Don't dump me...

16:38.390 --> 16:42.700
I'll crush that brilliance of yours!

16:42.700 --> 16:45.230
Sorry, but Tama is mine.

16:45.230 --> 16:49.270
I need to break even more girls using her.

16:49.270 --> 16:50.440
I-I don't want to!

16:50.440 --> 16:54.580
All until my very kind Tama-<i>chan</i>'s heart is broken to pieces!

16:54.580 --> 16:57.280
I... I won't let that happen!

16:57.280 --> 17:00.580
Iona is at Level 5, higher than Tama who's at Level 4!

17:00.580 --> 17:04.080
Well... how's this then?!

17:04.080 --> 17:05.210
Tama!

17:07.050 --> 17:12.360
I'll stain that beautiful body of yours in darkness!

17:19.630 --> 17:21.400
Tama! Tama...!

17:21.400 --> 17:22.870
Music to my ears...

17:22.870 --> 17:24.910
Impossible! Urith is entering Tama?!

17:24.910 --> 17:28.040
Aah... So beautiful...

17:28.040 --> 17:30.410
No! No! Why?!

17:30.410 --> 17:31.810
Why her?!

17:31.810 --> 17:34.820
Urith... is mine!

17:34.820 --> 17:38.250
R-Ru... Iona... What's happening...?

17:38.250 --> 17:41.320
Something is... entering Tama...!

17:41.320 --> 17:43.490
No... I don't want to...

17:43.490 --> 17:45.090
Help... Ru...!

17:45.090 --> 17:46.150
Tama!

17:49.300 --> 17:50.560
Tama...

17:50.560 --> 17:52.120
Grow.

17:55.740 --> 17:57.330
Again-lun?!

18:18.460 --> 18:21.600
It... can't be...

18:21.600 --> 18:23.430
Fafnir!

18:30.440 --> 18:31.170
Iona!

18:31.170 --> 18:33.000
End Slash!

18:44.690 --> 18:46.120
T-Tama...

18:46.120 --> 18:47.220
Hardcore...

18:47.220 --> 18:50.060
Stop! Stop, Tama!

18:56.130 --> 18:58.290
No...!

19:02.970 --> 19:04.530
Ruko!

19:15.150 --> 19:16.520
Iona?!

19:22.660 --> 19:23.890
Huh...?

19:32.830 --> 19:35.440
No... Tama did...

19:35.440 --> 19:38.270
N-No! Tama, you...

19:38.270 --> 19:40.070
Ru...

19:40.070 --> 19:42.110
Iona...

19:42.110 --> 19:45.240
Ionaaa...!

20:04.400 --> 20:06.730
Too bad...

20:07.730 --> 20:09.230
Iona!

20:16.780 --> 20:20.580
That was fun... you hopeless scum.

20:20.580 --> 20:22.250
W-Wait... Tama!

20:22.250 --> 20:23.420
Hitoe! Get a hold of yourself!

20:23.420 --> 20:25.390
Yuzuki... Ruko...!

20:35.230 --> 20:38.600
That felt great.

20:38.600 --> 20:39.900
Urith...

20:39.900 --> 20:41.570
What is it, Akira?

20:41.570 --> 20:45.070
Am I... unsightly?

20:45.070 --> 20:46.170
What?

20:48.240 --> 20:50.480
You're beautiful.

20:50.480 --> 20:53.580
You haven't changed ever since I've longed for you.

20:53.580 --> 20:57.250
We'll be together, forever...

20:57.250 --> 21:00.450
Let's have fun together...

21:00.450 --> 21:05.090
...with all the girls' wishes in this city.

21:12.630 --> 21:14.370
Urith...

21:14.370 --> 21:16.170
...you're...

21:43.630 --> 21:46.360
A... ki... ra...

21:52.470 --> 21:55.910
"This World is My Property"

22:02.320 --> 22:03.750
<i>Life...</i>

22:03.750 --> 22:09.220
<i>A city of mazes with no exit</i>

22:09.220 --> 22:13.730
<i>and the sound of bells ringing</i>

22:13.730 --> 22:15.360
<i>I do...</i>

22:15.360 --> 22:20.930
<i>Leave the "now" handed to me</i>

22:20.930 --> 22:25.670
<i>as I begin to walk in the morning</i>

22:25.670 --> 22:31.110
<i>In a world where light and dark intersect</i>

22:31.110 --> 22:37.280
<i>catharsis begins to awake</i>

22:37.280 --> 22:42.390
<i>I swore in my shaking heart</i>

22:42.390 --> 22:52.390
<i>that I won't lose anyone anymore...!</i>

22:54.130 --> 22:59.210
<i>Even if my tears flow tomorrow</i>

22:59.210 --> 23:05.910
<i>I'll run through the wind</i>

23:05.910 --> 23:10.950
<i>Release myself towards the future I selected</i>

23:10.950 --> 23:13.590
<i>to regain it</i>

23:13.590 --> 23:20.720
<i>I won't give up on my wish</i>

23:26.900 --> 23:28.900
I sense an unusual, evildoer's aura...

23:28.900 --> 23:29.640
Huh?

23:29.640 --> 23:31.170
Such evil...

23:31.170 --> 23:32.510
I'm evil?

23:32.510 --> 23:34.440
...your time of punishment will come!

23:36.440 --> 23:38.780
Justice will prevail!

23:38.750 --> 23:40.940
"That Abrupt Separation"

23:38.780 --> 23:40.810
That Abrupt Separation.
